    "chunk_text": "ht w\u00e6s fram \u00feam tungelwitegum; & he asende \u00d0a w\u00e6s gefylled \u00fe\u00e6t gecweden w\u00e6s \u00feurh Hieremiam \u00feone witegan. Stefn w\u00e6s on hehnysse gehyred, wop & mycel \u00feotorung; Rachel weop hyre bearn & heo nolde beon So\u00f0lice \u00fea Herodes w\u00e6s for\u00f0faren witodlice on swefne Drihtnes engel \u00e6tywde Iosepe on Egyptum. & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0, Aris & nim \u00fe\u00e6t cild & his modor & far on Israhelaland. Nu synd for\u00f0farene \u00fee \u00f0\u00e6s cildes sawle sohton. He aras \u00f0a & onfeng \u00fe\u00e6t cild & his modor & com on israhelaland. \u00d0a he gehyrde \u00fe\u00e6t Archelaus rixode on Iudea\u00feeode for \u00f0\u00e6ne Herodem he ondred \u00feyder to farende, & & he com \u00fea & eardode on \u00fe\u00e6re ceastre \u00f0e is genemned Nazareth \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6re gefylled \u00fe\u00e6t gecweden On \u00feam dagum com Iohannes se Fulluhtere; & bodude on \u00feam westene Iudee. & cw\u00e6\u00f0, Do\u00fe d\u00e6dbote; So\u00f0lice geneal\u00e6ce\u00f0 heofona rice. \u00d0is ys se be \u00feam \u00fee gecweden ys \u00feurh Esaiam \u00f0one witegan, Clypiendes stefn w\u00e6s on westene, Se Iohannes witodlice h\u00e6fde reaf of olfenda h\u00e6rum & fellenne gyrdel embe hys lendenu & hys mete \u00d0a ferde to him Hierosolimwaru & eal Iudea\u00f0eod & eal \u00fe\u00e6t rice wi\u00f0geondan Iordanen. & hi w\u00e6ron gefullode on Iordane fram him & hi andettan hyra synna. So\u00f0lice \u00fea he geseh manega \u00fe\u00e6ra",
